<!-- TL;DR -->
<div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Professional partition wall installation for offices, retail, and homes across Maidstone. Metal stud and timber options, sound-rated and fire-rated, with 12-month guarantee.</p>
</div>

<!-- What We Offer -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Our Partition Wall Services</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Partition walls are one of the fastest and most affordable ways to divide open-plan spaces into functional rooms. At <strong>Drylining Maidstone</strong>, we design and install partition walls using both timber and metal stud framing, with plasterboard finishes that look clean and professional.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Standard single-layer plasterboard partitions</li>
  <li>Double-layer soundproof partitions</li>
  <li>Fire-rated partitions (30–120 minutes)</li>
  <li>Metal stud partitions for commercial fit-outs</li>
  <li>Timber stud partitions for residential projects</li>
  <li>Demountable and relocatable partitions</li>
  <li>Integrated door and glazing frames</li>
  <li>Corner bead and professional joint finishing</li>
</ul>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Our Partition Walls?</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Fast and cost-effective:</strong> Partition walls are significantly cheaper and faster to install than traditional brick or block walls, with minimal disruption to your property.</li>
  <li><strong>Flexible and adaptable:</strong> Unlike permanent walls, partition walls can be modified, extended, or removed as your needs change.</li>
  <li><strong>Sound-rated options:</strong> We install acoustic insulation and sound-rated plasterboard to create quiet, private spaces in offices and homes.</li>
  <li><strong>Fire-rated compliance:</strong> Our fire-rated partitions meet Part B building regulations for commercial and public buildings.</li>
  <li><strong>Professional finish:</strong> Every partition is finished with corner beads, tape, and jointing compound for a seamless surface ready for decoration.</li>
</ul>

<!-- Materials -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Materials & Specifications</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">We use high-quality materials to ensure your partition walls are strong, compliant, and built to last.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Galvanised steel C-studs and U-tracks (50mm, 70mm, 92mm profiles)</li>
  <li>Sawn timber studs for residential partitions</li>
  <li>British Gypsum Gyproc plasterboard (standard, moisture-resistant, fire-rated, soundbloc)</li>
  <li>Knauf plasterboard and jointing systems</li>
  <li>Rockwool and Isover acoustic insulation batts</li>
  <li>Fire-rated intumescent sealants and cavity barriers</li>
  <li>Steel corner beads and edge trim</li>
  <li>Joint compound and paper tape for seamless finishing</li>
</ul>

<!-- Applications -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Applications & Use Cases</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our partition wall services are suitable for a wide range of building types and project sizes across Maidstone, from Bearsted offices to Harbourside retail units, Maidstone central homes, and Allington renovations.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Office space division and room creation</li>
  <li>Retail store fitting and back-of-house areas</li>
  <li>Residential room division and extensions</li>
  <li>Warehouse and industrial unit partitioning</li>
  <li>Healthcare facility room separation</li>
  <li>School and education building interiors</li>
  <li>Studio and workshop space configuration</li>
</ul>

<!-- How It Works -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">How It Works</h2>
<ol style="list-style:decimal;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Free Quote:</strong> Call or fill in our form. We will assess your space, discuss your layout needs, and provide a detailed, no-obligation quote.</li>
  <li><strong>Detailed Plan:</strong> We confirm stud type, board specification, insulation, and any door or glazing integrations. Everything is agreed upfront.</li>
  <li><strong>Professional Installation:</strong> Our team installs the framing, fixes plasterboard, and completes all joints and finishing to a professional standard.</li>
  <li><strong>Quality Check & Handover:</strong> We inspect every partition for straightness and finish quality, then leave your site clean and ready for decoration.</li>
</ol>

